WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.860
ANDRE: The boys are back.

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:04.800
Today we're talking about
Sam and Bucky, aka

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.720
Marvel Studios' "The Falcon
and The Winter Soldier."

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:08.520
I'm Andre.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.760
 And I'm Jenny.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.700
This is "What's Up,
Disney+," where

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.160
we talk all things Disney+.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:17.670
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:20.790
 Lorraine Cink is a senior
creative producer and host

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:22.920
of the Marvel Entertainment
YouTube channel,

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:25.260
and we are very thrilled
to have her here with us

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:28.140
today. Lorraine, welcome
to "What's Up, Disney+."

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:31.370
 Hey, Jenny, Andre, I'm so
excited to find out what's up.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.980
 Well, glad to have you here.

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:35.460
We know that you are
a huge Marvel fan.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:36.540
So how did you get into that?

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:38.400
 Well, like a lot
of kids, I learned

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.260
to read by reading
comics, and I just

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:41.580
fell in love with super heroes.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.680
And it's become a
lifelong passion.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.720
And now I've worked for
Marvel for 10 years,

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:48.810
written three books, and hosted
a whole lot of red carpets.

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:49.740
 That's amazing.

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:52.650
All right, Lorraine, we thought
who better to help us catch up

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:55.050
for Marvel Studios' "The
Falcon and The Winter Soldier"

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:55.850
than yourself?

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:57.300
 Oh yeah, on your left.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.210
Let's do it.

00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:00.180
 Well, I'm glad you're ready,
because a lot has happened

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:01.740
to these two characters
throughout the course

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:02.947
of the Marvel
Cinematic Universe,

00:01:02.947 --> 00:01:04.080
and we want to
catch everybody up.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.993
But, Lorraine, we like to
challenge ourselves here

00:01:05.993 --> 00:01:07.560
on "What's Up, Disney+,"
so we're going to try

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.240
to recap it in record time.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:10.050
Are you ready?

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:11.160
 Yes, I am ready.

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:12.780
I am channeling
all my superspeed.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:15.330
 All right then, let's do it.

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:16.860
In the Marvel
Cinematic Universe,

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:18.690
Bucky first appears
as Steve Rogers

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:21.590
bestie from Brooklyn, James
Buchanan Barnes, or Bucky

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:22.390
for short.

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:24.450
 Bucky went off to fight
in World War II, where

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.150
he reconnected with Steve,
now as Captain America,

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:29.970
while they tried to take
down a Hydra base in Austria.

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:32.610
 While Cap is victorious,
Bucky is thrown off a train

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:33.540
and thought to be dead.

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:35.850
 Fast forward years later,
when Sam and Cap become

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:37.800
close as fellow
veterans who lost a best

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:38.950
friend in the line of duty.

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:40.950
LORRAINE CINK: So when 
S.H.I.E.L.D. is infiltrated by 

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:43.200
Hydra, Sam gives Cap and Black
Widow a place to lay low.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.200
Which gets even more complicated
when an assassin starts hunting

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.300
them, named the Winter Soldier.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:50.580
 When he and Cap finally
come face to face,

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:52.710
he is revealed to be Bucky.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.030
 That's right, he's alive.

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:56.370
But his memory has been
wiped and modified by Hydra.

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:58.770
 Cap, Black Widow, and Sam
battle the Winter Soldier,

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:02.160
but Steve doesn't have the heart
to take out his best friend.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:04.530
 An unconscious Cap
falls to the water below,

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:06.870
and Bucky, regaining a
fragment of his former self,

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:08.500
dives in to save Steve.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.979
Then after, he leaves him on
the shore and disappears.

00:02:10.979 --> 00:02:12.690
 During Marvel
Studios' "Age of Ultron"

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:13.950
Bucky is nowhere to be seen.

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:16.680
But Sam does get an upgrade,
including a heroic costume

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:18.210
when the Avengers
expand their ranks

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:19.440
after the Battle of Sokovia.

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:20.970
 At the resulting
Sokovia Accords,

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:23.520
a bomb is detonated seemingly
by Bucky Barnes, which

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:25.290
kills the Wakandan
King, T'Chaka,

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:28.050
and his son, T'Challa,
pledges to kill Bucky himself.

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:30.660
 Captain America and Sam Wilson
head out to bring in Bucky.

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:32.880
However, it turns
out Bucky was framed.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.880
 Bucky, now in Winter Soldier
mode, beats Sam and escapes.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.800
Cap stops Bucky
and saves his life,

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:39.310
like Bucky once did for him.

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:41.370
 So when Sam and Bucky are
reunited on the same team,

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.770
Sam is not a huge fan of
Bucky who tried to assassinate

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:44.670
all of his best friends.

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:48.330
 During the epic showdown, Team
Cap and Team Iron Man face off,

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.280
and Bucky and Sam
manage to work together,

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:52.290
despite bickering like
an old married couple.

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:53.100
 I hate you.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.590
Zemo is revealed to be the
bomber, clearing Bucky's name,

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:57.000
and Team Cap goes after him.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.860
 Ultimately, Cap seeks
asylum in Wakanda,

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:01.260
where Bucky is put on ice to
remove his HydrA programming.

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:03.510
Poor Sam Wilson, unfortunately,
is locked up at the Raft

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:04.620
with the other Avengers.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.540
In Marvel Studios'
"Avengers: Infinity War"

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.660
we see Sam has been released and
allowed to rejoin the Avengers,

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:10.890
who take on Thanos.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.780
Bucky and Sam reunite
back in Wakanda,

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:15.780
battling the children of Thanos
and their army of Outriders.

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:17.880
 Then in a snap they're gone,
and we won't see them again

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.310
on anyone's left until they're
brought back later through Dr.

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:22.800
Strange's magic portals in the
epic final battle of Marvel

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:24.040
Studios' "Avengers: Endgame."

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:24.890
I love that part.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.820
 After all the dust clears,
a much-older Captain America

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:29.220
is revealed to have used the
quantum suit to go back in time

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:30.720
and return all of
the Infinity Stones.

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:32.400
Bucky looks on as
Captain America

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:33.872
passes the shield to Sam.

00:03:33.872 --> 00:03:34.776
[BELL RINGING]
- Woo!

00:03:34.776 --> 00:03:35.576
 Woo!

00:03:35.576 --> 00:03:37.840
We did it!

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:40.360
 What a journey that those
two characters have been on,

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.980
and what a journey we
just went through trying

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:43.120
to recap all of it.

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:45.910
Before you go, Lorraine,
can you tell us

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:48.010
what we can expect
coming up on the Marvel

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:49.150
Entertainment YouTube channel?

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:50.650
 Yeah, you can
check out everything

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:51.730
in the Marvel universe.

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:52.930
We're going to have
some cool stuff,

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:55.000
I'm sure, coming up for
Marvel Studios' "The Falcon

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:55.870
and The Winter Soldier."

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:58.270
Then, also go back and check
out some of the cool stuff

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:00.790
we created around Marvel
Studios' "WandaVision."

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:01.990
I mean, it's all there.

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:03.340
Just go-- go check it out.

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:05.380
 Well, thank you
so much, Lorraine,

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:09.220
for recapping this as quickly
as possible with Andre and I.

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:10.670
We can't thank you enough.

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:11.710
You are awesome.

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:13.370
 Oh my gosh, you
guys are awesome.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:16.180
You did so well with all
of that Marvel universe,

00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:18.190
because it is a lot,
let me tell you.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.180
Thank you so much for having me.

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:22.420
 And now, here's what's new.

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:25.140
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:28.410
JENNY: Break the fourth wall
of Marvel Studios' "WandaVision"

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:32.280
with Marvel Studios' "Assembled:
The Making of WandaVision,"

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:35.760
an original special now
streaming on Disney+.

