00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:03.620
 Now we get to
hear from Anthony

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:05.750
Mackie and Sebastian Stan.

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:07.280
Take a look.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.720
 I'm Sebastian Stan.

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:10.340
 And I'm Anthony
Mackie, and we are

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:13.100
the stars of Marvel
Studios' "The Falcon

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:14.210
and The Winter Soldier."

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:17.990
We are going to have
a compiment showdown.

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:18.920
 Where do we start?

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.420
 Sebastian, you
have wonderful hair.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.000
 OK, well you have
such a big heart that's

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.590
protected by a lot of strength.

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:28.460
 Sebastian, your personality
would make a grown man smile.

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:33.170
 The walls that you have
will protect me forever.

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:36.170
 You make me so happy I want
to sit in your lap and cuddle.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:40.400
 No couch will ever be as
firm and soft as your thighs.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:45.890
 You're like, the goose
down of beautiful people.

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:47.220
You're warm and inviting.

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:52.290
 I will always walk into
your shadow if I have to.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.810
 I'll be the man who
will fight for your honor.

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:59.250
 We don't need any
other heroes but you.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:02.610
 There's no way on Earth
that we could wake up

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:04.770
and it not be a sunny
day without thinking

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:07.680
of the face of Sebastian Stan.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:10.340
 I want to remake every
romantic comedy with you.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:16.410
 You, my friend, are the
scrambled eggs to my omelet.

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:17.620
 Oh my god.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:19.020
[BELL RINGING]

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.050
 I think I won.

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:20.850
 We were great.

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:23.700
Stream Marvel Studios' "The
Falcon and The Winter Soldier"

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:24.840
tomorrow on Disney+.

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:26.710
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:29.020
 We heard from Lorraine
Cink, and the cast

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:32.890
and crew of Marvel Studios' "The
Falcon and The Winter Soldier."

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:35.680
I don't know about you, Andre,
but I'm ready for action.

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:37.150
 Right there with you, Jenny.

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:38.650
Well, that's it for today.

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:40.570
Make sure you go over to
Disney+ and stream

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:42.970
all of your favorites, and
we'll see you next week.

